                        "entry_id": "dbe8dc05-8cac-3ca5-a641-193e0e0da9ca",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A Norse (and modern Heathen) ceremonial offering."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f65c6272-7d41-405d-b6b2-55b2f449cd47",
                                "sense_id": "6c6ec458-ed15-3832-85a1-312fd33bc36a",
                                "text": "These show us the importance of verbal activity at a blót, specifically verbal activity aimed at producing a result, presumably by means of intervention by the deities."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "25297f74-885d-46f4-b99b-745bed0c843e",
                                "sense_id": "6c6ec458-ed15-3832-85a1-312fd33bc36a",
                                "text": "In the past, before Christianity spread across Europe, the average blót would generally have involved some sort of animal sacrifice."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fccddca7-e3fc-4340-9479-40c27298af4a",
                                "sense_id": "6c6ec458-ed15-3832-85a1-312fd33bc36a",
                                "text": "He soon comes back to land, makes a largely undescribed blót sacrifice to Óðinn, and receives confirmation of his god's approval in the flight of two cawing ravens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "72d9533d-722f-4694-abdf-375c86662bfb",
                                "sense_id": "6c6ec458-ed15-3832-85a1-312fd33bc36a",
                                "text": "Do you know how to blót? / Do you know how to slaughter?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
